  "title": "Copycat Honey-Mustard Chicken Tenders",
  "description": "Chicken tenders are breaded in a seasoned flour mixture and garlicky bread crumbs and fried until dark and crispy in this copycat Chick-fil-A® chicken recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "RachelBF90"
  ],
